markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Practice
Let's try it it out! You'll use a Large Language Model (LLM) to improve your teaching practice.

To get you started, we have a small number of pre-developed prompts for you to choose from. Later in this module you'll get the chance to try additional prompts and to write your own.

Learn more about prompting and LLMs in Module 1, Introducing AI for Educators and Module 2, Understanding AI.

### Step 1: Choose a Large Language Model
👉 Click one of the tools below to open it in a new tab. If your school or district uses a specific AI tool, we recommend practicing with that platform.

